{"id":"boxeador","lemma":"boxeador","pos":"noun","rank":4919,"glosses":["boxer"],"ipa":"/boɡseaˈdoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"boxeadores","feminine":"boxeadora","femininePlural":"boxeadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-boxeador.wav","examples":[{"text":"El boxeador golpeó fuerte a su oponente.","en":"The boxer struck his opponent hard.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to hit","l":"golpear"},{"g":"strong"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"opposing"}]},{"text":"Los boxeadores necesitan reflejos rápidos.","en":"Boxers need quick reflexes.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"reflex","l":"reflejo"},{"g":"rapid","l":"rápido"}]},{"text":"El boxeador tenía que perder peso para la pelea por el título.","en":"The boxer had to lose weight for the title match.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},null,null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"fight, brawl"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"title"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"to lose weight"]]},{"text":"Tom se habría vuelto un boxeador si su mamá lo hubiera dejado.","en":"Tom would have become a boxer if his mother had let him.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"change"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"mum, mom"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"sloppy, lax"}]},{"text":"Mike Tyson es un boxeador.","en":"Mike Tyson is a boxer.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}